# Living Brain, Mechanical Marvel's "target non-Equipment artifact you control". On turn 1 Bot1 casts the Brain (four Moxen); turn 2 Bot2 casts its own Mox Sapphire. On turn 3
# Bot1 plays a Plains and casts Skullclamp (an Equipment) with Mox Pearl; at the beginning of combat neither the Skullclamp (an Equipment), the Plains (not an artifact) nor Bot2's Mox
# Sapphire (not Bot1's) can be targeted, while Bot1's own Mox Emerald can: it becomes a 3/3 artifact creature (turn 1's trigger had no better choice than the first candidate).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
